<h2>4. How It Works Section</h2>
<table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="2">
	<tr>
		<th style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Item</p>
		</th>
		<th style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Change</p>
		</th>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Step count</p>
		</td>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Reduced from 4 steps to
			3. Steps 1 (Invoice Arrives) and 2 (AI Reads &amp; Validates)
			merged into &quot;Upload &amp; Read in Seconds&quot;</p>
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Arrow connector</p>
		</td>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Removed — was rendering
			as a visual artefact across the section on some screen sizes</p>
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Step colours</p>
		</td>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Step 2 now uses cyan/teal
			(previously orange). Step 3 uses indigo-violet. Orange removed
			from the palette entirely.</p>
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Step 3 content</p>
		</td>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Expanded to include audit
			trail detail: who approved, any comments left, full history
			visible and traceable</p>
		</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Column layout</p>
		</td>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Updated from col-lg-3 (4
			columns) to col-lg-4 (3 columns) — better balance and
			readability</p>
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
