		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>Photos</p>
		</td>
		<td style="border: none; padding: 0in"><p>All 3 Unsplash stock
			headshots removed. Replaced with initials avatars
			(gradient-coloured circles — JW / SC / MO)</p>
